<SiteLayout title="Seller Order KH Privacy Policy" description="Privacy Policy for Seller Order KH.">
<section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap"><span class="eyebrow">App Privacy</span><h1>Seller Order KH Privacy Policy</h1><p>Pre-release privacy information for Seller Order KH.</p></div></section>
<section class="content"><div class="wrap prose"><p><strong>Last updated: August 20, 2026</strong></p><p><strong>Status: Pre-release draft.</strong> This policy will be reviewed against the final app implementation before publication on Google Play.</p><h2>1. Scope</h2><p>This Privacy Policy applies to Seller Order KH, a Kroma Digital application for managing seller orders and related records.</p><h2>2. Data handling</h2><p>The final data-handling behavior will depend on the released version. Before release, Kroma Digital will verify how order details, customer information, payment status, delivery information, notes, and related seller records are stored and whether any information is transmitted off-device.</p><h2>3. Permissions</h2><p>If the app uses contacts, phone features, notifications, camera or media access, file export, location, or other Android permissions, those permissions and their purposes will be documented here before release.</p><h2>4. Third-party services</h2><p>If the released app uses analytics, crash reporting, billing, advertising, cloud services, messaging, maps, or other third-party SDKs, this policy will identify those services and explain their role.</p><h2>5. Data retention and deletion</h2><p>The final release policy will explain how order and customer records are retained and how users can delete records or request deletion where applicable.</p><h2>6. Security</h2><p>Kroma Digital will use reasonable safeguards appropriate to the final implementation and the sensitivity of any customer, payment-status, or business information processed by the app.</p><h2>7. Changes</h2><p>This pre-release policy may change during development. The version published at this URL when the app is released will reflect the final implementation.</p><h2>8. Contact</h2><p>Privacy questions can be sent through the Kroma Digital Facebook page linked on our <a href="/contact">Contact page</a>.</p></div></section>
</SiteLayout>